  <form-events>
    <Event name="onLoad" paragraph="MAIN-FORM--ONLOAD"><![CDATA[       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

DATA DIVISION.

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SAVED-NAME          PIC X(40).

LINKAGE SECTION.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

*> On the phone, the name typed last time comes back from the phone's secure
*> storage (the Android Keystore, the iOS Keychain). In the Preview there is
*> no secure storage: SecureStatus answers -6 and WS-SAVED-NAME stays empty,
*> so the form simply starts fresh.

COBOL::SecureLoad( "user-name" WS-SAVED-NAME )
IF    WS-SAVED-NAME::Trim()::Len > 0
SET     TXT-NAME::Text            TO    WS-SAVED-NAME::Trim()
MOVE    SPACES                    TO    LBL-RESULT::Caption
STRING    "Welcome back, " WS-SAVED-NAME::Trim() "!" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO LBL-RESULT::Caption
END-IF.
]]></Event>
    <Event name="onClose" paragraph="MAIN-FORM--ONCLOSE">
    </Event>
  </form-events>
